  "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nInstalls the Sepo agent runtime and GitHub Actions scaffold into this repository via the existing-repository install flow.\r\n\r\nSource agent checkout: `self-evolving/repo` (https://github.com/self-evolving/repo/commit/8af626679d8aff87a7b4f09151f489e4c5ccfe2b ).\r\n\r\n## Installed files\r\n\r\n- Added `.agent/` runtime, docs, scripts, TypeScript sources, tests, and local runner tooling.\r\n- Added Sepo-owned `.github/actions/` composite actions.\r\n- Added Sepo-owned `.github/prompts/` prompt templates.\r\n- Added Sepo agent workflows under `.github/workflows/`:\r\n  - `agent-*.yml`\r\n  - `test-scripts.yml`\r\n\r\n## Conflict audit\r\n\r\n| Area | Outcome |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| `.agent/` | Absent in target; added from source with generated/dependency dirs excluded. |\r\n| `.github/` | Target had no overlapping Sepo files; added source files without deleting target-only content. |\r\n| Existing target `.github` files | Preserved: `dependabot.yml`, issue templates, PR template, and `workflows/deploy.yml`. |\r\n| `.skills/` | Not copied. |\r\n| `AGENT.md` | Not copied. |\r\n| Agent branches | No `agent/memory`, `agent/rubrics`, or other `agent/*` heads were present before install. |\r\n| Secrets / variables | No repository secrets or variables were visible via `gh secret list` / `gh variable list`; provider/auth settings still need owner configuration. |\r\n| Existing workflows | Preserved existing Pages/deploy/dependabot workflows. |\r\n\r\nNo target-owned files were removed or overwritten.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n- `git diff --check` / `git diff --cached --check` passed after removing copied trailing whitespace flagged by Git's whitespace check.\r\n- `npm --prefix .agent ci` passed.\r\n- `npm --prefix .agent run build` passed.\r\n- `npm --prefix .agent test` passed: 375/375 tests.\r\n- Parsed 28 GitHub workflow/action YAML files successfully.\r\n\r\n## Required setup after merge\r\n\r\n1. Ensure GitHub Actions are enabled.\r\n2. Configure at least one model provider secret:\r\n   - `OPENAI_API_KEY` for Codex-backed runs, and/or\r\n   - `CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN` for Claude-backed runs.\r\n3. Choose/confirm GitHub auth mode:\r\n   - recommended default: install the hosted [Sepo GitHub App](https://github.com/apps/sepo-agent-app/installations/select_target) for hosted OIDC auth,\r\n   - or configure BYO app secrets: `AGENT_APP_ID` + `AGENT_APP_PRIVATE_KEY`,\r\n   - or configure `AGENT_PAT` as a fallback,\r\n   - or rely on the workflow token fallback for lowest-friction/emergency use.\r\n4. Optional repository variables to consider:\r\n   - `AGENT_HANDLE`\r\n   - `AGENT_RUNS_ON`\r\n   - `AGENT_ACCESS_POLICY`\r\n   - `AGENT_DEFAULT_PROVIDER`\r\n   - `AGENT_MEMORY_POLICY`\r\n   - `AGENT_RUBRICS_POLICY`\r\n   - `AGENT_SESSION_BUNDLE_MODE`\r\n   - `AGENT_STATUS_LABEL_ENABLED`\r\n\r\n## Post-merge first-run steps\r\n\r\n- Check whether memory/rubrics branches already exist:\r\n  `git ls-remote --heads https://github.com/augmented-mind/augmented-mind.github.io.git agent/memory agent/rubrics`\r\n- If `agent/memory` is missing, run the `Agent / Memory / Initialization` workflow once.\r\n- If rubric steering is desired and `agent/rubrics` is missing, run `Agent / Rubrics / Initialization` once.\r\n- Open a smoke-test issue or comment mentioning `@sepo-agent /answer` after secrets/auth are configured.\r\n",
